From 7b9e2c26d4a180f0c95e8be7a1c3f46d9028ab21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brand Retention <brand-retention@local>
Date: Tue, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(brand): retain Hermes Studio branding on upstream 0.7.26
 (0009)

Regenerated for target 0.7.26 (commit 200f0eec). Upstream commit
91466ab2 (#2966, 2026-09-08) rebranded the product as Ekko Studio;
c19521d9 (#3232, 2026-09-30) drifted index.html and ChatView.vue so the
0.7.25-based 0009 no longer applied cleanly to those two files. Per
local brand policy the display name, window/dialog titles, tray menu,
installer strings, web titles, favicon, logos and app icons must stay
Hermes Studio; appId, publish/update URLs, config and data directories,
and MCP/API identifiers stay untouched.

- electron-builder.yml: productName, NSMicrophoneUsageDescription,
  artifactName restored; appId com.hermeswebui.studio and publish
  url https://download.ekkolearnai.com unchanged; upstream
  iconLinux/trayLinux extraResources entries kept with Hermes-branded
  assets (iconWindows.png/iconLinux.png/trayLinux.png derived from the
  same 0.7.18 assets).
- desktop main: index.ts (window titles, tray tooltip),
  desktop-i18n.ts, desktop-identity.ts (app.setName 'Hermes Studio';
  userData path stays pinned), group-chat-agent-popup.ts, cli-shim.ts,
  updater-helpers.ts appName fallback.
- installer.nsh: display strings only; dual-exe stop macro kept.
- client: index.html titles, ChatView productTitle, LoginView logo alt,
  AppConnectionsPanel Mobile label (APK download URLs untouched),
  manifest.webmanifest, main.ts error title, i18n locales.
- assets restored byte-for-byte from 0.7.18 (d5cd6a2): icon.ico/png/
  icns, icons/*, icon.icon/*, trayWindows/Mac/@2x, favicon.ico,
  logo.png, logo-original.png.
- updater-helpers keeps 'Ekko Studio-updater' in the legacy cache
  cleanup list; build-update-test.mjs / electron-builder.mjs
  update-test artifacts renamed back to Hermes naming (test infra
  only; no publish endpoints changed).

Verified with git apply --check against G:/Hermes/hermes-studio/W-0.7.26
(HEAD 200f0eec) and byte-level sha256 comparison of restored assets
against .scratch-work/clean718.

---
diff --git a/packages/client/index.html b/packages/client/index.html
index 35fa2a39..5af71c06 100644
--- a/packages/client/index.html
+++ b/packages/client/index.html
@@ -9,9 +9,9 @@
   <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" />
   <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f7f4" />
   <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
-  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Ekko Studio" />
+  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Hermes Studio" />
   <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
-  <title>Ekko Studio</title>
+  <title>Hermes Studio</title>
   <style>
     html,
     body,
diff --git a/packages/client/public/favicon.ico b/packages/client/public/favicon.ico
index 0aaa9c9f43ca7e2647eb13f30b599a2474c53538..dbc3f56759d9eb5ce9542fee493aeab693bb7e8f 100644
